## chart lifecycle Clawgs Extract/Emit Lifecycle
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Op as Operator/Tool
  participant CLI as clawgs CLI
  participant Disc as Discovery
  participant Parse as Parser (claude/codex)
  participant Emit as Emit Engine
  participant Back as Grok backend (optional)
  Op->>CLI: extract / emit --stdio / tmux-emit
  CLI->>Disc: locate cwd-exact JSONL (or --input)
  Disc-->>CLI: chosen transcript path
  CLI->>Parse: normalize JSONL (tolerant of malformed lines)
  Parse-->>CLI: clawgs.v2 snapshot (action_cues, commit_signal)
  CLI->>Emit: build clawgs.emit.v2 SessionSnapshot
  Emit->>Back: optional narration (missing creds -> last_backend_error, not crash)
  Emit-->>Op: NDJSON status update
  Note over Emit,Op: GREEN paths covered by emit_stdio/golden/schema_sync tests
```

## chart architecture-boundary Clawgs Architecture Boundary
```mermaid
flowchart TB
  subgraph inputs["Inputs (read-only, local)"]
    claude["~/.claude/projects/*.jsonl"]:::gray
    codex["~/.codex/sessions/YYYY/MM/DD/rollout-*.jsonl"]:::gray
    tmux["tmux panes (tmux-emit)"]:::gray
  end
  subgraph crate["clawgs crate (owned)"]
    parsers["GREEN src/parsers (claude, codex, jsonl helpers)"]:::green
    emitmod["GREEN src/emit (protocol, engine, model_client)"]:::green
    tmuxmod["GREEN src/tmux.rs pane scan -> SessionSnapshot"]:::green
    demo["GREEN src/demo.rs embedded corpus"]:::green
    refs["GREEN references/*.schema.json + *.md contracts"]:::green
  end
  subgraph out["Outputs (contracts, not a platform)"]
    v2["GREEN clawgs.v2 JSON"]:::green
    emitv2["GREEN clawgs.emit.v2 NDJSON"]:::green
  end
  subgraph ext["External (not owned)"]
    grok["Grok headless backend (optional narration)"]:::gray
    swimmers["Downstream Swimmers / tool authors"]:::gray
    cratesio["RED crates.io publish (0.3.0 pending)"]:::red
  end
  claude --> parsers
  codex --> parsers
  tmux --> tmuxmod
  parsers --> v2
  emitmod --> emitv2
  tmuxmod --> emitmod
  refs --> v2
  emitmod --> grok
  v2 --> swimmers
  emitv2 --> swimmers
  crate --> cratesio
  class claude gray
  class codex gray
  class tmux gray
  class parsers green
  class emitmod green
  class tmuxmod green
  class demo green
  class refs green
  class v2 green
  class emitv2 green
